; Portcullis + certify flags for the generated imt-gap R1CS book.
;
; This gadget embeds two full FieldLessThan comparators plus IsZero and a
; bool-select, so its *GADGET-IMT-GAP-constraints* literal is large enough that
; SBCL's file compiler overflows a (SIGNED-BYTE 19) offset while building the
; .fasl. Certify it interpreted (compile-flg nil) -- the book is pure generated
; constraint data, so there is no proof work to compile and no runtime cost that
; matters for downstream composition proofs.

(ld "rtl/rel11/package.lsp" :dir :system)
(include-book "kestrel/crypto/r1cs/portcullis" :dir :system)

; cert-flags: ? nil
